    "statement": "On the evidence supplied, the alert-triage agent operates at autonomy tier T2 within the retail structuring and rapid-movement alert-triage domain, may read, analyse, draft and recommend (A1-A4), is prohibited from A5-A12, and operates under analyst approval before any disposition, read-only customer-data access and evidence-preserving logging. This is a Level 1 Asserted Profile: nothing in it has been tested.",
